Requests pass through the stages top to bottom, responses bottom to top.

endpoint assist
  1. pii    fail_closed  policy standard
       roles: user, system
       CREDIT_CARD    replace  score >= 0.3
       EMAIL_ADDRESS  replace  score >= 0.5
       PERSON         keep     score >= 0.5
       PHONE_NUMBER   mask     score >= 0.5
       US_SSN         replace  score >= 0.3
  2. cache  fail_open    on: exact, ttl 1h, max_entries 10000, cache_salt "2026-10", route 36d88b08e3ba

endpoint chat
  1. pii    fail_closed  policy strict
       roles: user, system, assistant
       CREDIT_CARD    replace  score >= 0.3
       EMAIL_ADDRESS  replace  score >= 0.5
       LOCATION       replace  score >= 0.5
       PERSON         replace  score >= 0.5
       PHONE_NUMBER   replace  score >= 0.5
       US_SSN         replace  score >= 0.3
  2. cache  fail_open    off (middleware.overrides.chat.cache)

endpoint local
  1. pii    fail_closed  off (middleware.overrides.local.pii)
  2. cache  fail_open    on: exact, ttl 1h, max_entries 10000, cache_salt "2026-10", route 8ebe77ecb4d9

any other model (not an endpoint in kindling.yaml)
  1. pii    fail_closed  policy standard
       roles: user, system
       CREDIT_CARD    replace  score >= 0.3
       EMAIL_ADDRESS  replace  score >= 0.5
       PERSON         keep     score >= 0.5
       PHONE_NUMBER   mask     score >= 0.5
       US_SSN         replace  score >= 0.3
  2. cache  fail_open    on: exact, ttl 1h, max_entries 10000, cache_salt "2026-10", route none
